
1. To install, add this `<dependency>` in your maven `pom.xml`:

```xml
<dependency>
    <groupId>com.azure</groupId>
    <artifactId>azure-ai-inference</artifactId>
    <version>1.0.0-beta.1</version>
</dependency>
```

2. For each of the code snippets below, copy the content into a `sample.java` file and run as a package, for instance:

```bash
mvn clean package
mvn exec:java -Dexec.mainClass="com.github.models.inference.samples.BasicChatSample" -DGITHUB_TOKEN=[YOUR_GITHUB_TOKEN]
```
